  description: Afflicted or blessed by an unusual transformation of the body, Werewolves
    combine mortal intelligence with the instincts and physical might of beasts.
    The origins of their condition remain disputed, with theories ranging from ancient
    curses to forbidden bodily cultivation. Those capable of mastering their instincts
    become exceptionally dangerous warriors.
